<text x="230.369875" y="763.86995" size="3.81" layer="104">FABRICTION NOTES:</text>
<text x="229.16388125" y="750.828065625" size="3.81" layer="104">1)  Finished trace line widths should match
supplied gerber files (except where noted).</text>
<text x="229.16388125" y="743.099609375" size="3.81" layer="104">2)  Material:  FR4</text>
<text x="229.404928125" y="723.77808125" size="3.81" layer="104">3)  Copper weight;
Outer layers:  3/8 oz
Inner layers:  1/2 oz</text>
<text x="228.9228375" y="699.385190625" size="3.81" layer="104">4)  Top Solder mask: per IPC-SMA-840
X Liquid photoimageable
X Over bare copper
X Green</text>
<text x="229.646228125" y="686.5848625" size="3.81" layer="104">5)  Bottom Solder mask: 
X None</text>
<text x="229.40518125" y="673.542978125" size="3.81" layer="104">6)  Overall Board Thickness:
0.108 inches +/- 10%</text>
<text x="229.646228125" y="660.983946875" size="3.81" layer="104">7)  Bare Board Electrical Test:
X Tested to Netlist Data</text>
<text x="230.128575" y="641.662675" size="3.81" layer="104">8)  Hole Diameter Tolerances:
Plated Holes:  +/- 3 mils
Non-plated Holes:  +/- 2 mils</text>
<text x="230.369875" y="617.26953125" size="3.81" layer="104">9)  Silk Screen:
Top:  White
Bottom: None
</text>
<text x="230.58095" y="605.0714375" size="3.81" layer="104">10)  Minimum annular rings:
Internal:  5 mils
External:  5 mils</text>
<text x="230.09885625" y="585.997559375" size="3.81" layer="104">11)  Plane registration: 
+/- 5 mils to top plane for all planes
</text>
<text x="229.85755625" y="578.995796875" size="3.81" layer="104">12)  Minimum plating through all holes:
0.001" thick copper</text>
<text x="230.58095" y="571.99403125" size="3.81" layer="104">13)  Fabricate in accordance with IPC-6012 Class 2</text>
<text x="230.58095" y="558.956465625" size="3.81" layer="104">14)  Adjust ENIG specification as follows: 1.58 micro-inches
immersion gold over 50 micro-inches nickel</text>
<text x="231.06329375" y="552.196003125" size="3.81" layer="104">15)  Warp &amp; Twist not to exceed 7 mils per inch across the diagonal</text>
<text x="231.06329375" y="539.1584375" size="3.81" layer="104">16)  Acceptability: (per latest revision)
IPC-A-600</text>
<text x="231.06329375" y="526.36216875" size="3.81" layer="104">17)  Manufacturer to add MFR's Logo, date code,
UL code and ET stamp.  Top Layer only.</text>
<text x="231.06329375" y="513.807203125" size="3.81" layer="104">18) Vendor to supply cross sections and test
coupons per lot.</text>
<text x="230.82225" y="489.421934375" size="3.81" layer="104">19) Surface mount pads:
  Top Layer:  4392
  Bot Layer:        0
         Total:  4392</text>
